= <span style="color: #000000;">**Republic**</span> <span style="color: #c10000;">**Protection**</span> <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**Act**</span> negotiation

  
Since our only other options are appealing to the Reichsgericht, which might not be reliable, or calling a Reichsexekution through the Reichswehr, which might not be reliable, we have to find a compromise.

- @bavaria_offer: What will we offer?

@bavaria_offer  

- @bavaria_offer_1
- @bavaria_offer_2
- @bavaria_offer_3
- @bavaria_offer_4
- @bavaria_offer_5
- @bavaria_goal
- @fuck_bavaria_deals


@bavaria_offer_1
view-if: bav_opt_1 == 0
title: Pledge adherence to federalist principles and state's rights
on-arrival: protection_act_compromize_process += 1; bav_opt_1 = 1
go-to: bavaria_offer  

@bavaria_offer_2
view-if: bav_opt_2 == 0
title: Let Bavarian courts treat all cases of low relevance and those already in process
on-arrival: protection_act_compromize_process += 1; bav_opt_2 = 1
go-to: bavaria_offer

@bavaria_offer_3
view-if: bav_opt_3 == 0
title: Let the state court be occupied with represantatives from all regions of the Reich
subtitle: The State Court deals with matters of conflict between organs of the state
on-arrival: protection_act_compromize_process += 2; hitler_prozess_chances = -1; bav_opt_3 = 1
go-to: bavaria_offer
  
@bavaria_offer_4
title: Give a generous loan to Bavaria
subtitle: Everyone would hate this concession. (- 1 budeget)
choose-if: budget >= 1
view-if: bav_opt_4 == 0
unavailable-subtitle: We could never afford that
on-arrival: budget -= 1; protection_act_compromize_process += 3; bav_opt_4 = 1
go-to: bavaria_offer
  
@bavaria_offer_5
title: Give full autonomy to Bavaria
choose-if: z_relation >= 666
unavailable-subtitle: This is practical suicide
go-to: bavaria_offer

@bavaria_goal
title: The government of Bavaria will adopt the Republikschutzgesetz
choose-if: protection_act_compromize_process >= 5
on-arrival: bvp_relation += 3; z_relation += 2; super_mad_bavaria -= 1


@fuck_bavaria_deals
title: Actually we won't make any concessions
on-arrival: protection_act_compromize_process -= 10; super_mad_bavaria += 2

  
